121">You don't often get email from <a href="mailto:kurt.johnson@onebodydirect.com">kurt.johnson@onebodydirect.com</a>. <a href="https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification">Learn why this is important</a> </span></p></div></td><td width="75" style="width:56.25pt; background:#EAEAEA; padding:5.25pt 3.75pt 5.25pt 3.75pt; background:revert!important; border:revert!important; bottom:revert!important; color:revert!important; direction:revert!important; display:revert!important; font-size:revert!important; height:revert!important; letter-spacing:revert!important; line-height:revert!important; margin:revert!important; opacity:revert!important; order:revert!important; outline:revert!important; overflow:revert!important; padding:revert!important; position:revert!important; tab-size:revert!important; table-layout:revert!important; text-align:revert!important; text-indent:revert!important; text-orientation:revert!important; text-overflow:revert!important; text-transform:revert!important; top:revert!important; vertical-align:revert!important; white-space:revert!important; width:revert!important; word-break:revert!important; word-spacing:revert!important; writing-mode:revert!important; zoom:revert!important; visibility:visible"></td></tr></tbody></table><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">Hi Sean,</p><p class="MsoNormal">I run One Body LDN and I'm reaching out because I saw that our Wimbledon clinic is 5 min walk from your office. We've got 43 locations across London, and we treat a lot of people doing more or less your job, from KPMG, PwC and Deloitte among others. We fix backs, necks, shoulders, knees. Mostly from sitting.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">I want to give you a 45-minute sports massage, completely on me. Proper hands-on work on the back, neck and shoulders, the stuff that tightens up from sitting at a desk all day.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">Reply and I'll send you the booking code.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">Best regards</p><p class="MsoNormal">Kurt Johnson</p><p class="MsoNormal">Co-Founder @ One Body LDN</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p></div></body></html>", "from_email": "seandowney@rgjones.co.uk", "to_email": "kurt.johnson@onebodydirect.com", "stats_id": "36d7597e-4b97-4106-85a7-1d17e61364cb", "cc": ""}, {"kind": "sent", "timestamp": "2026-10-26 11:36:34.737000+00:00", "message_id": "<36d7597e-4b97-slt40-4106-85a7-1d17e61364cb-a1ibjxt@onebodydirect.com>", "body": "<p>Hi Sean,</p><p>Brilliant, let&#x27;s get you booked in for the free 45-minute sports massage first, then we can talk longer-term. Here&#x27;s the booking link:</p><p><a href="https://onebodyldn.connect.tm3app.com/book/partnerships/sports_massage_2/sports_massage_45_min" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://onebodyldn.connect.tm3app.com/book/partnerships/sports_massage_2/sports_massage_45_min</a></p><p>Use <strong>VIP8401</strong>. Wimbledon clinic is right there for you. Pick your time from the calendar when you book. There&#x27;s a small £4.99 booking fee, which holds your time slot.</p><p>On longer-term treatment, most of our clients end up on a short course of hands-on physio sessions. Every session is with an HCPC-registered physio, so it&#x27;s proper assessment plus manual treatment, not just exercises to do at home. Once you&#x27;ve had the massage, we can chat about what would help most and what that looks like.</p><p>Feel free to share the link and code with colleagues too, each person gets one free session.</p><p>Let me know when you&#x27;re booked in.</p><p>Best<br>Kurt</p><br><br><table
